        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we offered the following services to our customers:",
        "start_character": 5835,
        "end_character": 5911
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we reduce the markets in which we provide retail wireless services, the significance to our business of regulatory obligations applicable only to our retail services has and will continue to diminish.",
        "start_character": 41346,
        "end_character": 41549
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For traditional voice and broadband services, we compete with GCI and AT&T on a statewide basis, and smaller providers such as Matanuska Telephone Association, Inc., a co-op owned telephone and internet service provider operating in the Matanuska Valley region of Alaska, on a more local basis.",
        "start_character": 20097,
        "end_character": 20391
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Historically, we offered mobile services to retail customers in certain rural markets already covered by our wholesale networks in the western US.",
        "start_character": 21264,
        "end_character": 21410
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In Alaska, we provide fiber broadband, fixed wireless access, digital subscriber line (“DSL”) and managed IT services, offering technology and service-enabled customer solutions to business and wholesale customers in and out of Alaska.",
        "start_character": 16067,
        "end_character": 16302
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer other value-added services such as network hosting, managed IT services and long-distance services.",
        "start_character": 16763,
        "end_character": 16884
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our international markets, we offer fixed, carrier, mobility and managed services to customers in Bermuda, the Cayman Islands, Guyana and the US Virgin Islands.",
        "start_character": 7347,
        "end_character": 7510
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In select markets, we also serve carrier customers by leveraging our network assets to provide communications services.",
        "start_character": 495,
        "end_character": 614
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the US, we offer fixed, carrier, and managed services to customers in Alaska and the western US.",
        "start_character": 7546,
        "end_character": 7645
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the western US, we provide fiber and fixed wireless services to business customers such as schools, libraries, mine operators and state and local governments as well as residential customers.",
        "start_character": 17104,
        "end_character": 17298
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the western US, we provide network infrastructure services as part of our expanded carrier services, such as tower leasing and transport facilities to our carrier partners, to supplement our historic revenue base.",
        "start_character": 12685,
        "end_character": 12901
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-028515",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-028515-7cb7be5e7103d87d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-028515",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the western US, we provide wholesale mobile voice and data roaming services, as well as wholesale transport services to national, regional, local and select international wireless carriers.",
        "start_character": 12067,
        "end_character": 12259
      }
    ]
